# Firebase service-account credentials (Admin SDK / FCM HTTP v1)
# Defense-in-depth duplicate of the root .gitignore rules. These files contain a
# raw private key and must NEVER be committed. Supply the path via
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH or GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS in .env.
service-account.json
serviceAccount.json
service_account.json
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*serviceAccountKey.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*firebase-adminsdk-*.json
firebase-service-account*.json
*firebase-service-account*.json
